OL,3,GNEWSAThousands without power and some
OL,4,Aflights cancelled as Storm Austen
OL,5,Alashes South West England
OL,6,
OL,7,FPower cuts are affecting more than
OL,8,F9,000 homes in Cornwall and Devon as
OL,9,FStorm Austen hits parts of the UK
OL,11,FLoganair confirms 18 flights have been
OL,12,Fcancelled today, including services
OL,13,Ffrom Jersey and to Cornwall Newquay -
OL,14,Fhere's a quick look at some of the
OL,15,Ftravel disruption we've seen so far
OL,17,FA red warning is in place for Guernsey
OL,18,Fand Jersey; Cornwall and parts of Devon
OL,19,Fare under an amber weather warning for
OL,20,Fstrong winds. A yellow rain warning is
OL,21,Fin place in parts of Scotland,
OL,22,Fincluding the Lothian Borders
