OL,3,GNEWSAThousands without power and some
OL,4,Aflights cancelled as Storm Austen
OL,5,Alashes South West England
OL,6,
OL,7,FAll schools in Jersey and Guernsey are
OL,8,Fclosed. A number of schools are also
OL,9,Fclosed or opening late in Cornwall
OL,11,FA further yellow weather warning for
OL,12,Fwind is kicking in from 10:00 for
OL,13,Fmillions across the South East and
OL,14,FNorth West of England, the East
OL,15,FMidlands and Wales
OL,17,FOn Saturday, a separate storm, named
OL,18,FBoelo, is forecast to bring more strong
OL,19,Fwinds to Scotland and Northern Ireland
OL,20,Fas well as North West and North East
OL,21,FEngland
